+The full 100-account mixed command stops before fixture creation at the unchanged disk-headroom guard; the preceding measurement was 11.61 GiB available, below the required greater-than-12 GiB. The previous full mixed failure remains open. Restore safe host headroom before another full run, and continue addressing measured per-command CPU/pool hold time without weakening validation, isolation, deadlines or data recovery. QUALITY-03 and RELEASE-01 remain IN PROGRESS; cloud provisioning and hosted/physical acceptance stay pending. [Current evidence, exact commands, compatibility and preservation checks](evidence/performance-2026-10-25/README.md).
